				"integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, an eight-second 16:9 action sequence set inside a vast ruined industrial complex at night. A massive emerald-green humanoid giant with bulging muscles and torn dark trousers faces a towering steel monster covered in scratched armor plates, glowing red eyes, heavy mechanical claws, and exposed hydraulic joints. Rain pours through the broken roof as both creatures roar and charge across the flooded concrete floor. The camera tracks rapidly beside them with large amplitude, emphasizing their enormous scale. [Shot 2] At 00:02.500, the camera cuts to a low-angle medium-wide shot as the green giant leaps forward and throws a powerful right punch. The steel monster raises both armored forearms to block it; the collision releases a violent metallic shockwave, scattering sparks, water, and concrete fragments through the air. The camera shakes strongly at the exact moment of impact. The steel monster immediately swings a massive claw toward the giant, who ducks beneath it and drives his shoulder into the monster's chest. [Shot 3] At 00:05.500, the shot cuts to a fast arc shot circling both fighters as they grapple fiercely, crushing steel beams beneath their feet. The green giant lifts the steel monster, spins with explosive force, and slams it onto the flooded floor. A circular wave of water and debris erupts outward while the camera pulls back rapidly, ending on the green giant roaring over the damaged but still-moving steel monster amid sparks, smoke, and falling rain.\n\noverall_soundscape: Heavy rain strikes metal and flooded concrete throughout the battle. Thunderous footsteps, muscular roars, grinding machinery, hydraulic hisses, metallic punches, cracking concrete, flying debris, and a massive final impact fill the scene.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Rapid low percussion and aggressive brass pulses drive the fight, joined by distorted industrial rhythms. The music rises sharply during the final slam and ends on one sustained low orchestral hit.",
